340
23:41.110 --> 23:43.310
to flatten the Divine Constable Bureau

341
23:43.440 --> 23:44.900
and turn Tianshu Pavilion

342
23:45.000 --> 23:46.760
into ruins.

343
24:35.680 --> 24:38.520
When I was still in the Crown Prince's residence,

344
24:39.200 --> 24:40.920
that fool Zhou Tiao

345
24:40.920 --> 24:42.650
loved watching plays the most.

346
24:43.350 --> 24:44.380
Now,

347
24:45.000 --> 24:46.660
the overall situation is set.

348
24:47.200 --> 24:48.040
I

349
24:48.480 --> 24:51.390
actually have the mood to watch a play too.

350
24:55.590 --> 24:56.410
I wonder what good play

351
24:56.410 --> 24:58.270
you want to watch, Your Holiness.

352
24:58.590 --> 24:59.720
I

353
25:00.200 --> 25:02.630
prefer real plays with real singing.

354
25:43.790 --> 25:45.480
The story must be real.

355
25:46.240 --> 25:49.450
And the actors must be real too.

356
25:51.830 --> 25:52.630
He is

357
25:53.040 --> 25:55.100
Prince Ding of the Great Shi Dynasty,

358
25:55.200 --> 25:56.040
Zhou Miao.

359
25:59.730 --> 26:00.610
He is

360
26:00.830 --> 26:03.160
the Crown Prince of the Great Shi Dynasty,

361
26:03.440 --> 26:04.350
Zhou Tiao.

362
26:08.000 --> 26:08.830
Your Majesty,

363
26:10.830 --> 26:12.760
can you guess?

364
26:14.870 --> 26:16.640
If I guess correctly,

365
26:16.680 --> 26:18.110
Your Holiness, what you want to see

366
26:18.110 --> 26:19.760
is the death of Zhou Yan

367
26:20.200 --> 26:21.730
at the Mulan Hunting Ground

368
26:23.000 --> 26:24.480
17 years ago.

369
26:38.760 --> 26:40.310
♪ Congratulations, Fourth Brother ♪

370
26:40.310 --> 26:43.680
♪ You're right ♪

371
27:30.520 --> 27:32.350
Father.

372
27:50.070 --> 27:51.760
This play is not bad.

373
27:52.720 --> 27:54.380
The royal family of Great Shi,

374
27:54.630 --> 27:57.590
from top to bottom, are all scheming,

375
27:57.590 --> 27:59.870
hypocritical, and treacherous people.

376
28:00.830 --> 28:01.800
Today,

377
28:02.110 --> 28:03.300
my Liluo

378
28:03.680 --> 28:06.440
will occupy the territory of Great Shi.

379
28:06.790 --> 28:10.000
I will use this farce from 17 years ago,

380
28:10.070 --> 28:13.070
a genuine case of a brother killing a brother,

381
28:14.000 --> 28:17.010
to bury the Great Shi royal family.

382
28:18.960 --> 28:23.960
♪ Spring boughs claim the palace pagoda shade ♪

383
28:23.960 --> 28:27.440
♪ Twenty years of roiling envy ♪

384
28:27.440 --> 28:32.070
♪ Frosted blade hid beneath embroidered collar ♪

385
28:32.070 --> 28:35.550
♪ To make him ♪

386
28:35.580 --> 28:44.380
♪ Ruin his young life ♪

387
28:45.350 --> 28:50.070
♪ I envied my brother Zhou Yan favored by my family ♪

388
28:50.070 --> 28:56.390
♪ I sent assassins to slay him ♪

389
28:57.680 --> 29:03.550
♪ Dragons in the depths forged their league ♪

390
29:03.550 --> 29:10.520
♪ Iron chains barred the river, blocking his return ♪

391
29:10.680 --> 29:13.680
♪ I aided the Crown Prince, fooling Father ♪

392
29:13.680 --> 29:20.520
♪ I swore Fourth Brother shall not come back ♪

393
29:39.870 --> 29:41.000
See?

394
29:41.480 --> 29:43.590
No emperor

395
29:43.870 --> 29:45.550
would allow anyone

396
29:45.550 --> 29:47.350
to covet his throne,

397
29:47.790 --> 29:48.590
even if

398
29:48.960 --> 29:51.870
it's his own biological son.

399
29:52.200 --> 29:53.720
When the play is over,

400
29:54.000 --> 29:56.240
I will cut off

401
29:56.240 --> 29:57.760
this old fool's head

402
29:59.150 --> 30:03.430
and present it to you as a coronation gift, Your Majesty.

403
30:18.760 --> 30:19.830
They're coming so fast.

404
30:19.830 --> 30:21.200
There are so many of them.

405
30:21.200 --> 30:22.000
General,

406
30:22.040 --> 30:23.210
if we wait for other troops to reinforce us,

407
30:23.210 --> 30:24.550
I'm afraid it'll be too late.

408
30:24.550 --> 30:26.350
Once these demon-men are let in,

409
30:27.280 --> 30:28.110
Great Shi

410
30:28.830 --> 30:30.110
will cease to exist.

411
30:30.550 --> 30:31.830
We must become

412
30:32.110 --> 30:33.680
the iron wall of Great Shi.

413
30:35.830 --> 30:36.760
Soldiers!

414
30:37.390 --> 30:38.440
Liluo demon-men

415
30:38.720 --> 30:39.760
know no pain,

416
30:39.960 --> 30:41.150
understand no fear,

417
30:41.480 --> 30:43.070
are invulnerable to weapons,

418
30:43.070 --> 30:44.550
and are hard for mortals to defeat.

419
30:44.550 --> 30:45.720
Because of this,

420
30:45.720 --> 30:47.250
they will never understand

421
30:47.630 --> 30:49.110
that flesh and blood

422
30:49.310 --> 30:50.720
can erupt

423
30:50.720 --> 30:52.380
strong soul-burning flames!

424
30:52.470 --> 30:59.140
[Shi]

425
30:53.040 --> 30:54.720
They don't know what a homeland is

426
30:54.720 --> 30:55.790
and what honor is,

427
30:56.070 --> 30:57.550
and they will never understand

428
30:57.550 --> 30:59.280
that what we protect behind us

429
30:59.350 --> 31:01.150
is our toughest shield!

430
31:01.870 --> 31:02.720
Those who defy

431
31:02.960 --> 31:04.290
march toward the abyss!

432
31:04.630 --> 31:05.560
Those who wander

433
31:05.830 --> 31:07.430
find their life's true home!

434
31:07.590 --> 31:10.420
[Shi]

435
31:09.240 --> 31:10.680
Soldiers of the Vanguard Camp!

436
31:10.680 --> 31:11.440
-Yes! -Yes!

437
31:11.630 --> 31:12.440
Today,

438
31:12.960 --> 31:14.110
follow me,

439
31:14.390 --> 31:16.040
using broken bones as monuments

440
31:16.040 --> 31:17.440
and hot blood as inscriptions,

441
31:17.440 --> 31:18.630
to defend our country to the death!

442
31:18.630 --> 31:21.660
[Shi]

443
31:18.830 --> 31:20.630
-Defend the country to the death! -Defend the country to the death!

444
31:20.630 --> 31:21.920
-Defend the country to the death! -Defend the country to the death!

445
31:21.920 --> 31:25.650
-Defend the country to the death! -Defend the country to the death!

446
31:45.040 --> 31:45.830
Charge!

447
31:54.020 --> 31:54.870
Jiuying?

448
31:55.830 --> 31:56.720
Li Si.

449
31:57.480 --> 31:58.440
The wolf cub

450
31:59.150 --> 32:01.740
tried to sneak into Yuque to find you,

451
32:01.870 --> 32:03.270
but I caught her.

452
32:11.480 --> 32:12.440
Kill her.

453
32:14.350 --> 32:15.610
I'll bite you to death,

454
32:15.630 --> 32:16.900
you old witch!

455
32:21.960 --> 32:22.760
Why?

456
32:23.440 --> 32:25.680
How dare you disobey my order?

457
32:29.480 --> 32:30.280
I, Zhou Yan,

458
32:31.040 --> 32:33.040
follow your orders, Your Holiness.

459
32:45.830 --> 32:46.720
Li Si.

460
32:47.630 --> 32:48.520
Xia Jiuying,

461
32:49.350 --> 32:50.150
you said

462
32:51.680 --> 32:53.790
you like shadow puppets spinning.

463
32:55.200 --> 32:56.040
Jiuying,

464
32:56.280 --> 32:57.590
the biggest taboo

465
32:57.630 --> 32:58.630
in shadow puppetry

466
32:58.630 --> 33:00.480
is to tangle the strings together.

467
33:00.480 --> 33:02.640
These strings seem tough,

468
33:02.720 --> 33:04.270
but if they are all tangled together

469
33:04.270 --> 33:05.720
and rub against each other,

470
33:05.720 --> 33:07.240
they will easily snap.

471
33:09.550 --> 33:11.550
You are a shadow puppet now.

472
33:11.830 --> 33:13.350
Whatever I want you to do,

473
33:14.110 --> 33:15.680
you have to do it.

474
34:07.870 --> 34:08.670
Jiuying!

475
34:10.710 --> 34:11.520
Jiuying,

476
34:11.670 --> 34:12.520
are you okay?

477
34:13.040 --> 34:14.100
Li Si,

478
34:14.840 --> 34:15.800
I'm fine.

479
34:22.520 --> 34:23.320
Jiuying,

480
34:23.920 --> 34:25.100
you did a great job.

481
34:25.750 --> 34:27.110
I can finally...

482
34:28.630 --> 34:31.070
help the Divine Constable Bureau.

483
34:34.290 --> 34:35.080
Jiuying.

484
34:35.710 --> 34:36.520
Jiuying.

485
34:47.070 --> 34:49.110
You really were acting.

486
34:50.440 --> 34:52.150
I have practiced the Liluo Technique

487
34:52.150 --> 34:53.270
for 70 years,

488
34:54.320 --> 34:57.040
and have long become invincible.

489
34:57.360 --> 34:59.670
Your painstaking sword strike

490
35:00.270 --> 35:01.070
only

491
35:01.190 --> 35:03.800
consumed a little of my power.

492
35:04.400 --> 35:06.040
What I am curious about is

493
35:07.150 --> 35:09.350
why the Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart

494
35:09.710 --> 35:11.630
couldn't control you.

495
35:13.980 --> 35:17.070
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

496
35:14.750 --> 35:17.440
The Five-Color Stone is a meteorite from outer space.

497
35:17.110 --> 35:20.000
[I've devised a plan: feign breaking the formation to lure them into the trap.]

498
35:18.070 --> 35:19.480
It has the miraculous effect of sensing the spiritual energy

499
35:19.480 --> 35:21.000
of heaven, earth, mountains, lakes, and all things.

500
35:20.000 --> 35:21.590
[Once the rebels all arrive, we shall restore the formation and trap them all.]

501
35:22.070 --> 35:23.150
Fifty years ago,

502
35:23.330 --> 35:25.200
a part of it was stolen by Liluo.

503
35:25.880 --> 35:27.820
The Soaring Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation

504
35:27.820 --> 35:29.620
uses all things as instruments.

505
35:30.480 --> 35:32.320
The skills I taught you

506
35:32.670 --> 35:35.070
are enough to make you the envy of the world.

507
35:35.920 --> 35:38.380
This is what it means to repay a debt!

508
35:38.670 --> 35:41.940
To repay it in full!

509
35:54.040 --> 35:56.520
So the half stolen by Liluo

510
35:56.630 --> 35:59.690
was actually forged into the Heaven-Measuring Ruler.

511
36:01.630 --> 36:03.110
No wonder when it pierced in,

512
36:03.110 --> 36:04.910
it could suppress the bug venom.

513
36:05.670 --> 36:07.650
Then if it is buried in the body,

514
36:08.110 --> 36:09.270
wouldn't the whole body

515
36:09.270 --> 36:10.040
be a small

516
36:10.040 --> 36:11.590
Guili Formation?

517
36:47.810 --> 36:48.890
As the saying goes,

518
36:49.880 --> 36:52.300
"Those who do evil will destroy themselves."

519
36:52.300 --> 36:53.530
Qiangong Linglong,

520
36:53.900 --> 36:54.730
today

521
36:55.440 --> 36:57.150
is the day you die.

522
36:58.150 --> 36:59.330
Don't worry,

523
36:59.840 --> 37:01.960
I will let you die knowing why.

524
37:04.750 --> 37:05.880
This new emperor

525
37:06.150 --> 37:07.360
must be disposed of.

526
37:15.980 --> 37:16.550
[Divine Constable Bureau]

527
37:50.110 --> 37:51.320
Liluo thieves,

528
37:51.520 --> 37:53.120
we have been waiting for you!

529
38:05.840 --> 38:06.630
This is bad.

530
38:07.330 --> 38:08.580
The Guili Formation.

531
38:09.230 --> 38:10.670
You really do have a conspiracy.

532
38:10.670 --> 38:11.840
Hurry to the Tianshu Pavilion!

533
38:11.840 --> 38:13.150
As long as we live, the bureau survives!

534
38:13.150 --> 38:15.000
-As long as we live, the bureau survives! -As long as we live, the bureau survives!

535
38:15.000 --> 38:15.360
[Pillar of the Realm]

536
38:20.530 --> 38:21.700
Qiangong Linglong,

537
38:22.290 --> 38:24.090
I'm afraid you still don't know.

538
38:24.480 --> 38:25.800
Although these years,

539
38:25.830 --> 38:27.190
the Chiying Bug Venom

540
38:27.330 --> 38:29.540
has always made me suffer unbearably,

541
38:29.640 --> 38:30.930
my body

542
38:31.710 --> 38:33.800
has also been mutated because of it.

543
38:35.070 --> 38:36.960
I have to thank you for this.

544
38:37.190 --> 38:39.240
Chop him into meat paste for me

545
38:39.320 --> 38:40.250
to feed the dogs.

546
39:19.540 --> 39:20.600
[Chief Constable's Hall]

547
39:50.740 --> 39:51.720
Zhou Yan,

548
39:52.020 --> 39:54.100
you are all alone now.

549
39:54.630 --> 39:56.750
Let's see how long you can hold on.

550
39:56.750 --> 39:57.800
Where are those

551
39:57.800 --> 40:00.330
companions of yours who share life and death?

552
40:00.630 --> 40:02.320
Where are they now?

553
40:07.800 --> 40:08.840
Right here!

554
40:23.670 --> 40:25.040
How can a fight

555
40:25.040 --> 40:26.320
be without me?

556
40:26.880 --> 40:27.740
Your Highness,

557
40:27.960 --> 40:29.040
I'm not late, am I?

558
40:29.550 --> 40:30.400
Sanhuo,

559
40:30.590 --> 40:31.670
as long as you're here,

560
40:31.670 --> 40:32.710
it's not too late.

561
40:32.880 --> 40:33.800
-Qingyang! -Li Si!

562
40:33.800 --> 40:34.320
Qingyang, what's wrong?

563
40:34.320 --> 40:35.670
-What's wrong? -Qingyang!

564
40:35.670 --> 40:36.720
Chiying bug.

565
40:37.480 --> 40:38.400
You two,

566
40:39.320 --> 40:40.480
listen to me carefully.

567
40:40.480 --> 40:42.150
No matter what happens later,

568
40:42.150 --> 40:43.800
you must trust me.

569
40:45.190 --> 40:46.000
Qingyang.

570
40:47.270 --> 40:48.070
Yan.

571
40:50.110 --> 40:52.670
The Liluo people will be here soon.

572
40:53.560 --> 40:54.850
Hurry out of the city

573
40:55.110 --> 40:57.190
and ask Zhu to bring troops to help!

574
41:19.800 --> 41:21.070
Prince Ping is leading the Vanguard Camp

575
41:21.070 --> 41:22.190
to meet the enemy outside the palace.

576
41:22.190 --> 41:23.110
Leave the enemies outside the palace

577
41:23.110 --> 41:24.360
to Zhu.

578
41:24.750 --> 41:26.280
As for the enemies in Yuque,

579
41:27.590 --> 41:29.320
it's up to you and me.

580
41:29.750 --> 41:30.550
Today,

581
41:30.960 --> 41:32.960
let these Liluo scums

582
41:33.070 --> 41:33.880
see

583
41:33.880 --> 41:36.000
the courage of our Divine Constable Bureau!

584
41:36.000 --> 41:37.370
And me.

585
41:38.480 --> 41:39.480
And me!

586
41:39.480 --> 41:40.190
Jiuying.

587
41:43.070 --> 41:43.880
Jiuying.

588
41:44.270 --> 41:46.000
You are seriously injured now.

589
41:46.070 --> 41:47.270
The most urgent thing

590
41:47.480 --> 41:49.070
is to quickly take away the bodies

591
41:49.070 --> 41:50.600
of my father and my brother.

592
41:52.320 --> 41:53.400
I will cover you.

593
41:53.670 --> 41:54.480
Yan.

594
41:56.070 --> 41:58.070
Qiangong Linglong is protected by the technique.

595
41:58.070 --> 41:59.230
What we need to do

596
42:00.150 --> 42:01.070
is stall her.

597
42:01.110 --> 42:01.920
Don't worry.

598
42:02.480 --> 42:03.810
Even if it costs my life,

599
42:04.110 --> 42:05.400
I will stall her.

600
42:06.630 --> 42:08.290
Overestimating yourselves.

601
42:08.880 --> 42:10.150
With just you two

602
42:10.590 --> 42:12.360
and even the Vanguard Camp,

603
42:13.150 --> 42:14.630
you can't defeat

604
42:14.630 --> 42:16.400
my demon-men army.

605
42:23.270 --> 42:24.440
Shut up, old witch!

606
42:24.840 --> 42:25.630
Yan!

607
43:15.680 --> 43:16.210
Chang Bo.

608
43:24.150 --> 43:25.070
Yan Zisheng,

609
43:25.670 --> 43:26.550
your brother

610
43:26.550 --> 43:28.400
was a loyal man to the country.

611
43:28.710 --> 43:29.800
You sold yourself to Liluo

612
43:29.800 --> 43:30.670
to be a demon-man.

613
43:30.670 --> 43:32.320
You are not as good as your brother.

614
43:32.320 --> 43:34.230
To avenge my brother,

615
43:35.040 --> 43:38.170
killing dozens of people in the Divine Constable Bureau

616
43:38.500 --> 43:40.100
is worth it.

617
43:42.650 --> 43:44.000
Kill me.

618
43:54.170 --> 43:55.870
[Chief Constable's Hall]

619
44:07.880 --> 44:09.400
A dignified Chief

620
44:09.480 --> 44:11.850
who perished within the Divine Constable Bureau

621
44:11.850 --> 44:14.080
died a worthy death.

622
44:17.960 --> 44:18.710
Charge!

623
44:39.550 --> 44:40.710
That's not right.

624
44:41.190 --> 44:42.480
Doesn't your Divine Constable Bureau

625
44:42.480 --> 44:43.710
always talk about

626
44:43.710 --> 44:45.000
brotherhood?

627
44:46.380 --> 44:47.540
Why are there

628
44:47.570 --> 44:49.200
only two of you now?

629
44:50.360 --> 44:51.480
Where are the others?
